---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Traits e interfaces — Forja">
  <h1>Traits e interfaces</h1>

  <p>Forja soporta <strong>rasgos</strong> (interfaces/traits) y su implementación para clases. Permiten definir comportamientos compartidos y polimorfismo paramétrico con genéricos.</p>

  <h2>Definir un rasgo</h2>

  <div class="code-block-wrapper">
    <div class="code-header"><span><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ruler"/></svg> Sintaxis</span></div>
    <pre><code><span class="kw">rasgo</span> NombreRasgo &lbrace;
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> metodo1(param1: <span class="ty">Tipo</span>) -> <span class="ty">Retorno</span>
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> metodo2() <span class="co">// opcional: cuerpo por defecto</span>
&rbrace;</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h2>Implementar un rasgo</h2>

  <div class="code-block-wrapper">
    <div class="code-header"><span><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-dna"/></svg> Implementación</span></div>
    <pre><code><span class="kw">rasgo</span> Mostrar &lbrace;
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> <span class="fn">mostrar</span>() -&gt; <span class="ty">Texto</span>
&rbrace;

<span class="kw">clase</span> Punto &lbrace;
    x
    <span class="kw">constructor</span>(x) &lbrace; <span class="kw">este</span>.x = x &rbrace;
&rbrace;

<span class="kw">implementa</span> Mostrar <span class="kw">para</span> Punto &lbrace;
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> <span class="fn">mostrar</span>() -&gt; <span class="ty">Texto</span> &lbrace;
        <span class="kw">retornar</span> <span class="st">&quot;Punto(&quot;</span> + <span class="kw">este</span>.x + <span class="st">&quot;)&quot;</span>
    &rbrace;
&rbrace;

<span class="kw">variable</span> p = <span class="kw">nuevo</span> <span class="fn">Punto</span>(<span class="nu">3</span>)
<span class="fn">escribir</span>(p.<span class="fn">mostrar</span>())</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h2>Ejemplo completo</h2>

  <div class="code-block-wrapper">
    <div class="code-header"><span><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-graduation-cap"/></svg> Rasgos + Clases</span></div>
    <pre><code><span class="kw">rasgo</span> Volador &lbrace;
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> <span class="fn">volar</span>() -&gt; <span class="ty">Texto</span>
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> <span class="fn">aterrizar</span>() -&gt; <span class="ty">Texto</span>
&rbrace;

<span class="kw">clase</span> Pajaro &lbrace;
    nombre
    <span class="kw">constructor</span>(n) &lbrace; <span class="kw">este</span>.nombre = n &rbrace;
&rbrace;

<span class="kw">implementa</span> Volador <span class="kw">para</span> Pajaro &lbrace;
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> <span class="fn">volar</span>() -&gt; <span class="ty">Texto</span> &lbrace;
        <span class="kw">retornar</span> <span class="kw">este</span>.nombre + <span class="st">&quot; está volando...&quot;</span>
    &rbrace;
    <span class="kw">funcion</span> <span class="fn">aterrizar</span>() -&gt; <span class="ty">Texto</span> &lbrace;
        <span class="kw">retornar</span> <span class="kw">este</span>.nombre + <span class="st">&quot; aterrizó&quot;</span>
    &rbrace;
&rbrace;

<span class="kw">variable</span> p = <span class="kw">nuevo</span> <span class="fn">Pajaro</span>(<span class="st">&quot;Tweety&quot;</span>)
<span class="fn">escribir</span>(p.<span class="fn">volar</span>())
<span class="fn">escribir</span>(p.<span class="fn">aterrizar</span>())</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h2>Genéricos con rasgos</h2>

  <div class="code-block-wrapper">
    <div class="code-header"><span><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-refresh-cw"/></svg> Genéricos boundeados</span></div>
    <pre><code><span class="kw">funcion</span> imprimir&lt;T&gt;(valor: T) &lbrace;
    <span class="fn">escribir</span>(valor)
&rbrace;

<span class="fn">imprimir</span>(<span class="st">&quot;texto&quot;</span>)
<span class="fn">imprimir</span>(<span class="nu">42</span>)</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h2>Cláusula <code>donde</code></h2>

  <p>Para bounds complejos con múltiples rasgos, usá la cláusula <code><span class="kw">donde</span></code>:</p>

  <div class="code-block-wrapper">
    <div class="code-header"><span><svg class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-map-pin"/></svg> Where</span></div>
    <pre><code><span class="kw">funcion</span> procesar&lt;T&gt;(valor: T) -&gt; <span class="ty">Texto</span> &lbrace;
    <span class="kw">retornar</span> <span class="st">&quot;procesado: &quot;</span> + valor
&rbrace;

<span class="fn">escribir</span>(<span class="fn">procesar</span>(<span class="st">&quot;dato&quot;</span>))</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h2>Keywords relacionadas</h2>

  <table>
    <tr><th>Keyword</th><th>Descripción</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>rasgo</code></td><td>Define una interfaz</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>implementa</code></td><td>Implementa un rasgo para una clase</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>donde</code></td><td>Cláusula where para bounds complejos</td></tr>
  </table>
</Layout>
